t-palisade.audit.json", "tool_use_id": "toolu_017NWTLTzRtCB1PTRUTkiv1f"}], "text_tail": "relative can verify or pay for the holder\" has no field in the schema.\n  - \"Ask for missing clock time\" for callbacks also has no field.\n\n**What the documents leave open (listed in `unresolved`):**\n- There is no rule for products more than 90 days late.\n- The counter-offer when a customer offers less than the lowest amount, and treating its rejection as a refusal, have no dedicated field.\n- When a customer refuses to talk twice, all remaining products are marked R-1. Before identity is verified, the call instead closes as IDStop/I-2.\n\nThe full coverage list is in `out/ext-palisade.audit.json`."}
